---
/*
  Grain.astro — canonical mount for the single site-wide .riso-grain overlay.

  MOUNT RULE (enforced by convention, documented in README.md):
    Render this component EXACTLY ONCE per page — as the first child of the
    layout root (body or the outermost layout wrapper). Later phases (Hero,
    layout overrides) import this component rather than adding a second
    .riso-grain element. A second mount would double the noise opacity and
    break the single-GPU-layer contract.

  No props — this component is a singleton with no configuration surface.
  Opacity and blend mode are governed by --blac-grain-opacity (riso.css).
*/
---

<div class="riso-grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
